    <string name="disclaimer_title">Before you scan</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_body">This app is an informational consumer tool. It is not a medical device and it is not a substitute for the printed ingredient list, a dermatologist, or official EU annexes. Ratings can lag regulatory updates. Unknown names are shown, never treated as safe. Ads never appear on the camera or ingredient review screens.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_accept">I understand</string>
    <string name="onboarding_next">Next</string>
    <string name="onboarding_scan_title">What a scan does</string>
    <string name="onboarding_scan_body">Point the camera at a barcode or the printed INCI list (skład). Scoring stays on this device. If a barcode is missing from the catalog and you are online, the ingredient list is fetched and evaluated automatically. You can also type a GTIN or paste the list if the camera cannot read the pack.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_unknown_title">Unknown is not safe</string>
    <string name="onboarding_unknown_body">If a name is not in the knowledge base, it is listed as Unknown. Results can be incomplete. Edit OCR mistakes before you evaluate. Community catalog formulas are marked unverified.</string>

